# ========================================================
# Hammer Script - Block Comments (note ... end note)
# ========================================================

show "=================================================="
show "        Multi-line Block Comments Demo            "
show "=================================================="

note
    This is a multi-line note block in Hammer Script!
    Everything written between 'note' and 'end note'
    is completely ignored by the compiler and interpreter.

    You can write explanations, documentation, or disable
    entire chunks of code easily:

    show "This will never run!"
    set secret to 12345
end note

set activeVar to "I am running normally!"
show "Active code: " + activeVar

note
Another note block with notes for the team:
- Version: 2.1
- Engine: Hammer Script Core
- Status: Fully working
end note

show "Program continues flawlessly after multiple note blocks!"
show "=================================================="
